{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">張智霖（Chilam）與袁詠儀（靚靚）的兒子「魔童」（張慕童）轉眼間已成長為20歲的少年。日前，魔童以結他手身份驚喜現身張智霖的演唱會舞台，為爸爸現場伴奏，隨即成為全場歌迷與網民的焦點。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"de1f2287-53e1-4aff-9fc3-ed6bcb4973a2.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20260GlyYx5hiG1787563260.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"de1f2287-53e1-4aff-9fc3-ed6bcb4973a2.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">演唱會當晚，魔童身穿全黑造型，手抱電結他坐在舞台一角專注彈奏。面對現場大批觀眾，他展現出從容沉穩的表現，全程絲毫不見怯場。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"09773b27-24f1-4163-b80e-295c9cb3ac78.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026kuzyedYZeD1787563260.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"09773b27-24f1-4163-b80e-295c9cb3ac78.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"24bf6cbf-ff93-4c71-82ef-1e5fe3b7198a.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026kie1AtWwGR1787563259.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"24bf6cbf-ff93-4c71-82ef-1e5fe3b7198a.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了音樂才華，魔童的高顏值亦引來網民熱議。留著俐落短髮的他，側臉線條清晰且五官立體，完美繼承了父母張智霖與袁詠儀的優良基因。不少網民看過現場影片後紛紛大讚他帥氣兼具才華，更形容他是「同爸爸餅印咁靚仔」，展現了基因的重要性。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T09:38:57.367024+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}